WEBVTT

00:07:27.405 --> 00:07:30.465
Where you come from now
is much less important

00:07:30.489 --> 00:07:32.113
than where you're going.

00:07:32.137 --> 00:07:34.509
More and more of us
are rooted in the future

00:07:34.533 --> 00:07:37.805
or the present tense
as much as in the past.

00:07:37.829 --> 00:07:40.368
And home, we know, is not just the place

00:07:40.392 --> 00:07:42.478
where you happen to be born.

00:07:42.502 --> 00:07:46.951
It's the place where you become yourself.

00:07:46.975 --> 00:07:49.373
And yet,

00:07:49.397 --> 00:07:52.038
there is one great problem with movement,

00:07:52.062 --> 00:07:55.249
and that is that it's really
hard to get your bearings

00:07:55.273 --> 00:07:56.867
when you're in midair.

00:07:56.891 --> 00:08:00.153
Some years ago, I noticed
that I had accumulated